  "kioskIntro": "Turns this device into a dedicated digital photo frame: PhotoFrame becomes selectable as the home screen (home app), and the screen is pinned (screen pinning) when the slideshow starts, so nobody accidentally switches to another app.",
  "kioskExitNowButton": "Exit screen pinning now",
  "kioskHomeAppNote": "After enabling this, the next time you press the Home button a system dialog appears letting you set PhotoFrame as the default home screen. You have to confirm that yourself - Android does not let apps confirm or bypass that dialog automatically.",
  "kioskPinningNote": "As soon as the slideshow starts, the screen is pinned (screen pinning). Since this app has no device-owner/MDM privileges, Android may show a small \"unpin\"/\"exit\" hint at the top of the screen while pinned - that is platform behaviour and cannot be fully suppressed by this app.",
